          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif;'><div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:2.5px; color:#0f172a; border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom:6px; margin-bottom:18px;'>PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE</div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #38bdf8; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Staff Infrastructure Engineer — Stripe</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2022 - PRESENT</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Architected global multi-region payment ledger processing $140B+ annually at 99.999% availability and <12ms p99 latency.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #38bdf8; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Senior Systems Engineer — Cloudflare</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2019 - 2022</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Built zero-copy Rust edge proxy workers handling 28M requests/sec across 300+ global PoP data centers.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #38bdf8; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Software Engineer II — Google Cloud</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2017 - 2019</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Developed Spanner query optimizer passes reducing cross-continental transaction lock contention by 34%.</div></div></div>",
